01:33:59.750 --> 01:34:01.360
And then there's the
business side of Japan,

01:34:01.360 --> 01:34:04.563
which is like the exact
opposite of convenience.

01:34:05.550 --> 01:34:06.860
But like just living here,

01:34:06.860 --> 01:34:10.640
I feel like I get the best of Japan,

01:34:10.640 --> 01:34:12.120
because I'm self-employed,

01:34:12.120 --> 01:34:14.430
