01:34:21.180 --> 01:34:22.600
everyone's life inconvenient.

01:34:22.600 --> 01:34:23.840
Like as Garnt's saying about business.

01:34:23.840 --> 01:34:26.750
They'll keep people in the
chain and of the business

01:34:26.750 --> 01:34:28.120
that shouldn't be in the chain.

01:34:28.120 --> 01:34:30.210
Like there'll be middlemen in everything

01:34:30.210 --> 01:34:31.790
