01:34:47.170 --> 01:34:49.723
the things I love, I like the safety.

01:34:51.440 --> 01:34:53.640
Living in London is
kind of sketch at times.

01:34:54.560 --> 01:34:55.590
- Speaking of sketch,

01:34:55.590 --> 01:34:56.784
