01:35:11.450 --> 01:35:13.890
I was very good at
eating just like potato.

01:35:13.890 --> 01:35:14.977
I'd be like, oh, this
is amazing, isn't it?

01:35:14.977 --> 01:35:16.780
It's just a potato.

01:35:16.780 --> 01:35:18.770
- Exactly, that when you come to Japan,

01:35:18.770 --> 01:35:21.513
