01:35:42.046 --> 01:35:44.090
- Is it locally grown?

01:35:44.090 --> 01:35:46.680
- Which prefecture are
these strawberries from?

01:35:46.680 --> 01:35:47.513
- Oh really?

01:35:47.513 --> 01:35:49.520
That prefecture, embarrassing.
- Oh no, no, no, no.

01:35:49.520 --> 01:35:51.920
- What do you mean it didn't cost $1,000

01:35:51.920 --> 01:35:54.260
