that's appealing to me.

01:36:06.940 --> 01:36:09.263
Unless I travel all the way up
to London in the city center.

01:36:09.263 --> 01:36:10.990
- Takeout's really good here.

01:36:10.990 --> 01:36:12.330
Take out in the UK, it's like,

