01:36:29.474 --> 01:36:31.123
What do you like most about Japan?

01:36:32.430 --> 01:36:35.050
- Well, you know, the
thing I liked about America

01:36:35.050 --> 01:36:36.470
was that it's really diverse.

01:36:36.470 --> 01:36:41.470
You could go anywhere and
really just feel at home.

01:36:41.500 --> 01:36:43.101
- Me too, I really like the friendliness.

01:36:43.101 --> 01:36:43.934
- It's very friendly,

01:36:43.934 --> 01:36:45.250
and you can have
conversations with anyone.

01:36:45.250 --> 01:36:47.420
- It's very open.
- But in Japan,

01:36:47.420 --> 01:36:49.980
it's hard to get friendly with people.

01:36:49.980 --> 01:36:51.270
I think it takes time.

01:36:51.270 --> 01:36:55.010
