01:37:41.667 --> 01:37:43.900
I'm like, why would you,
what are you gonna do?

01:37:43.900 --> 01:37:44.940
- Things just work here.

01:37:44.940 --> 01:37:46.650
And that's what I love about Japan.

01:37:46.650 --> 01:37:50.270
It's just, everything you
didn't think about works,

01:37:50.270 --> 01:37:51.560
and then except for business,

01:37:51.560 --> 01:37:53.070
the business side, but just like I said,

01:37:53.070 --> 01:37:54.630
everything outside of
that just perfectly work.

01:37:54.630 --> 01:37:57.393
- I didn't realize the
London Underground was,

01:37:57.393 --> 01:37:58.623
I mean, I knew it was dirty,

01:37:58.623 --> 01:38:01.006
