01:38:29.760 --> 01:38:34.040
Like when I went to San
Jose to do my first concert,

01:38:34.040 --> 01:38:36.000
like, you know, it was
American-style concert.

01:38:36.000 --> 01:38:39.400
So we were already used to
doing the Japanese style,

01:38:39.400 --> 01:38:42.790
