01:39:05.330 --> 01:39:07.610
So the Japanese team was there waiting-

01:39:07.610 --> 01:39:08.990
- Just confused.

01:39:08.990 --> 01:39:10.490
- Was like, oh, what do we do?

01:39:10.490 --> 01:39:13.140
And then we're, okay, so
lunch break is one hour.

