So at one o'clock, we come back
and we do rehearsals again.

01:39:16.180 --> 01:39:17.990
So we were planning on that.

01:39:17.990 --> 01:39:21.020
But then like the camera
people and the lighting people

01:39:21.020 --> 01:39:23.976
