01:39:32.516 --> 01:39:36.230
the show, boom, they do their thing.

01:39:36.230 --> 01:39:37.063
They do their thing.

01:39:37.063 --> 01:39:38.000
They don't need rehearsal.

01:39:38.000 --> 01:39:39.840
They just, boom, they do their thing.

01:39:39.840 --> 01:39:42.900
- Oh, damn, that's, most
conventions I've been to,

01:39:42.900 --> 01:39:44.520
there have been like
technical difficulties

01:39:44.520 --> 01:39:46.106
on like every panel

01:39:46.106 --> 01:39:48.050
that I've hosted.
- You got it easy.

01:39:48.050 --> 01:39:49.900
- My flight had technical difficulty.

01:39:52.050 --> 01:39:54.527
- That's, you know, that's
how the world works.

01:39:54.527 --> 01:39:58.380
And Japan is just very
perfectionism in production.

01:39:58.380 --> 01:40:01.640
- They're just like a little
too over-cautious at times,

01:40:01.640 --> 01:40:04.100
