stressing out about this?

01:40:04.100 --> 01:40:06.260
You don't have to have 17 rehearsals.

01:40:06.260 --> 01:40:08.160
I think one or two is enough.

01:40:08.160 --> 01:40:11.470
- How many rehearsals do you
have for a Japanese concert?

01:40:11.470 --> 01:40:14.410
- It depends on the event,
but we do, definitely,

01:40:14.410 --> 01:40:17.370
we do a lot of rehearsals beforehand.

01:40:17.370 --> 01:40:20.720
And we'll do like, before the shows,

01:40:20.720 --> 01:40:23.270
we go through, it's called genepro,

01:40:23.270 --> 01:40:28.270
but it's a rehearsal where
you do it exactly like-

01:40:28.700 --> 01:40:30.660
- So basically just a dress rehearsal.

01:40:30.660 --> 01:40:33.570
- Yeah, the show exactly how it's done.

01:40:33.570 --> 01:40:36.490
And you probably need to
do that two or three times.

01:40:36.490 --> 01:40:37.323
- Bloody hell.

01:40:37.323 --> 01:40:38.610
- So when you perform a concert,

01:40:38.610 --> 01:40:40.206
you're not just performing it once,

01:40:40.206 --> 01:40:43.010
you're performing it like four
times in secret most of it.

01:40:43.010 --> 01:40:45.497
- When it's big-

01:40:45.497 --> 01:40:47.393
- It's only the last time that counts.

01:40:48.900 --> 01:40:51.440
- Going back, like a million topics,

01:40:51.440 --> 01:40:53.170
going back to the, 'cause
I'm really intrigued

