like talked about the process.

01:41:09.440 --> 01:41:10.473
It'd be a waste not to.

01:41:10.473 --> 01:41:12.114
- I think it depends on the artist,

01:41:12.114 --> 01:41:17.114
but if you're signed with
an anime-based label,

